📝 YouTube Description 
Prepare your heart for Lent with this short, peaceful 10+ minute audio guide.
In this episode, we walk through the Lenten Regulations for 2026 from the Diocese of Brooklyn — including fasting, abstinence, Reconciliation Monday, the Easter Vigil, and the spiritual practices that help us enter Lent with intention.

This episode also includes a special reflection on the 2026 Diocesan Lenten Pilgrimage, inviting the faithful to journey spiritually and physically toward deeper communion with Christ. Whether you are traveling or uniting your steps from home, this year’s pilgrimage becomes a moment of grace woven into the rhythm of Lent.

